  "excerpt": "С туденты ОрГМУ приняли участие в профилактическом мероприятии , которое прошло в рамках национального проекта « Молод е жь и дети ». Мастер-класс для населения состоялся в фельдшерско-акушерском пункте. Участникам…",
  "body_html": "<p class=\"p\" style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">С</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">туденты ОрГМУ </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">приняли участие в профилактическом мероприятии</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">, которое </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">прошло в рамках национального проекта </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">«</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Молод</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">е</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">жь и дети</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">». Мастер-класс для населения состоялся </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">в </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">фельдшерско-акушерском пункте.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Участникам рассказали об алгоритмах действий при неотложных состояниях</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">, разъяснили</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">ключевые моменты: как оценить состояние пострадавшего, когда вызывать скорую</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">помощь</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">, какие действия предпринимать до приезда врачей, как не растеряться в критической ситуации.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">